  (text "BQ25628E or BQ25622E - I2C, ADC, decent protections but no battery undervolt, small 2.5x3mm\n	- *22 has 10mA min charge termination, *28 has 5mA\n	- *28 is cheaper on mouser (24/08/2024)"
    (at 22.86 39.37 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 47ee830a-ebbd-4775-9a1f-1d1b28c076a8)
  )
  (text "Requirements:\n- Power Path\n- Some form of ADC for voltage reading\n- At least battery overcharge/discharge and input overvolt\n- Down to 50mA charge current\n- Preferably battery undervolt protection\n- Preferably not BGA"
    (at 24.13 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 63aaad05-547e-4403-b4b1-920ca6a1d108)
  )
  (text "BQ25186 - Looks pretty perfect, small, all protections, cheap, but not available"
